        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "This letter will confirm our mutual understanding with regard to employees who were reclassified to the Bargaining Unit classification of \"Offset Press Operator,\" at the time the Employer agreed to discontinue the use of the non-bargaining job classification \"Offset Press Operator Confidential.\"",
