        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. It is understood by the Union that work which is of a \"Secret\" or \"Confidential\" nature because of the fact that it deals with labor-management matters or is especially sensitive and considered \"Privileged\" by the Company (i.e., financial reports, competitive bidding information, or proprietary data, etc.) may require special handling. In such cases the reproduction of such material may be performed by non-bargaining personnel. The Company shall limit the performance of such work to that which it considers to be truly necessary and will advise the Union's representatives of the need to have such work performed.",
